  description: '"Fallen of Albaz" + 1 monster with 2500 or more ATK

    Gains ATK
    equal to the combined original Levels of the monsters used for its Fusion Summon
    x 100. After this card is Fusion Summoned, for the rest of this turn, it is unaffected
    by the activated effects of any other monsters Special Summoned from the Extra
    Deck. During the End Phase, if this card is in the GY because it was sent there
    this turn: You can add to your hand, or Special Summon, 1 "Fallen of Albaz" or
    "Dogmatika" monster from your Deck. You can only use this effect of "Titaniklad
    the Ash Dragon" once per turn.'
